                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b68f2e57-d751-3331-bfe6-d91f173a4aee",
                        "entry_id": "ee36f94d-0ad9-347e-80cc-72ca23196168",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterised or marked by giggling."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "620a12f1-1794-4bb5-9f7b-ef69a7a0e515",
                                "sense_id": "b68f2e57-d751-3331-bfe6-d91f173a4aee",
                                "text": "And I ran across one the other day, \"gigglesome.\" \"The children were so gigglesome,\" which I think is just wonderful."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bef5d82-634a-41d6-9718-871c742566f2",
                                "sense_id": "b68f2e57-d751-3331-bfe6-d91f173a4aee",
                                "text": "The phone rang constantly and long gigglesome conversations took place on it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "448b914c-223f-41c6-97a8-8d7aeb49abf5",
                                "sense_id": "b68f2e57-d751-3331-bfe6-d91f173a4aee",
                                "text": "We are joined by Michael Fathers, Asia editor of The Independent, and his not-very-bright, gigglesome interpreter, I think another Nguyen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf4d9fc4-ac2c-4350-b96e-317a870ffe08",
                                "sense_id": "b68f2e57-d751-3331-bfe6-d91f173a4aee",
                                "text": "Everyone was puffed and pink by now, having danced to Papa's friend's gramophone for a good half-hour in a fairly confined space, which meant a certain amount of giggle-some jostling and a good deal of body heat, so that the air was over-warm and unhealthy with the scent of talcum and cheap cologne and the inside panes of the orangery were clouded."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "999dc06d-60e1-4b19-9a95-fa263918b4f8",
                                "sense_id": "b68f2e57-d751-3331-bfe6-d91f173a4aee",
                                "text": "But the truth was that she was twice as high-spirited and gigglesome as her companion."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
